Error [jet.ValueNotSendable]: `window` cannot cross a parallel worker boundary — it is a view that does not live long enough
  --> tests/ui/closures/parallel_adapters_reject_unsafe_boundaries_before_codegen_2.jet:5:36
    |
  5 |     ignored: [1, 2, 3].para_filter((n: Int) -> window.contains(n))
    |                                    ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
 Why: A view is a borrow, not an owned value; this concurrent boundary moves owned values between workers
 Fix: Copy plain owned data into the worker, or keep this operation sequential
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E1102
